OL,3,GNEWSASteam Packet profits nearly double
OL,4,
OL,5,FThe Isle of Man Steam Packet Company
OL,6,Falmost doubled its profit to #12.3m
OL,7,Flast year, up from #6.9m, as it carried
OL,8,Fa record number of passengers,
OL,9,Faccording to its latest annual report.
OL,11,FThe government-owned ferry operator
OL,12,Falso cut the amount it owes the
OL,13,FTreasury, with net debt falling from
OL,14,F#114.7m to #96.2m.
OL,16,FThe increase was partly driven by an
OL,17,Fextra #2m earned from renting out two
OL,18,Fvessels, while the previous year's
OL,19,Fprofit was reduced by a #2.2m
OL,20,Fwrite-down in the value of the freight
OL,21,Fship Arrow.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
