OL,3,GNEWSASteam Packet profits nearly double
OL,4,
OL,5,FHowever, this year's financial
OL,6,Fperformance could be affected by the
OL,7,Floss of the flagship Manxman, which has
OL,8,Fbeen out of service since July while
OL,9,Fundergoing repairs expected to cost
OL,10,Fabout #5m.
